      "options": {},
      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "A Julia set is drawn from one complex number, C. Two Oscillators a quarter turn apart walk C round a circle once a loop, so the set melts and reforms; its Smooth escape count colors a Cosine Gradient. Pull the cables out and drag C Real and C Imaginary by hand, or turn Zoom and Iterations."
        }
      },
      "width": 380.0
